### 4주차 시연용 요청 모음 (VS Code "REST Client" 확장 기준. 위에서부터 차례로 Send Request)
### 터미널에서 한 번에 돌리려면 ./demo.sh

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@placeUrl = https://m.place.naver.com/restaurant/1234567890/home

### 1. 개발용 로그인 (local 프로필 전용)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "owner@example.com"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 1-1. 내 정보
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 매장 등록
# @name store
POST {{base}}/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "시연 한식당", "category": "KOREAN"}

###
@storeId = {{store.response.body.data.storeId}}

### 3. 메뉴 등록 (반복해서 여러 개 등록)
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"posName": "김치찌개(1인)", "aliases": ["김치 찌개"]}

###
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"posName": "아메리카노(ICE)", "aliases": ["아아"]}

###
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"posName": "제육볶음"}

### 3-1. 메뉴 목록
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 매출 CSV 업로드
# @name upload
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/sales/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY

--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sales_sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/sales_sample.csv
--BOUNDARY--

###
@uploadId = {{upload.response.body.data.uploadId}}

### 4-1. 같은 기간 다시 업로드 (replace=true 면 교체)
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/sales/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY

--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="replace"

true
--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sales_sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/sales_sample.csv
--BOUNDARY--

### 4-2. 업로드 이력 / 오류 행
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/sales/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/sales/uploads/{{uploadId}}/errors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 플레이스 링크 미리보기
# @name preview
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/place/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"placeUrl": "{{placeUrl}}"}

### 5-1. 플레이스 연결
PUT {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/place
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"placeId": "{{preview.response.body.data.placeId}}"}

### 6. 리뷰 수집 요청 (202)
# @name collect
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/review-collections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6-1. 작업 상태 (COMPLETED/FAILED 가 될 때까지 다시 보내기)
GET {{base}}/jobs/{{collect.response.body.data.jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6-2. 작업 이력
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/jobs?type=REVIEW_COLLECT&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. (대체 수단) 리뷰 파일 등록
POST {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/reviews/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY

--BOUNDARY
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="reviews_sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/reviews_sample.csv
--BOUNDARY--

### 8. 리뷰 원문 목록
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/reviews?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-09-30&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 매출 요약 (일별)
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/sales/summary?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&groupBy=DAY
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 매출 요약 (메뉴별)
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}/sales/summary?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31&groupBy=MENU
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 매장 상세
GET {{base}}/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 로그아웃 (리프레시 쿠키 삭제)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
